  "level": 0,
  "ordinal": 0,
  "summary": "The Tankship Tromedy\nOne of the more interesting books dedicated to understanding the tanker business was recently published and is entitled, \"The Tankship Tromedy.\" The author, Mr. Jack Devanney, draws on 30 years of working experience in the tanker industry to be able to define it as a Tromedy - both a tragedy and comedy. This book provides an in depth analysis of spills that have taken place in the past and provides suggestions for prevention in the future.",
